 lines += ["","Fold-specific paired leakage-group bootstrap intervals are retained in `bootstrap/PAIRED_CI.csv`; folds are not pooled. Calibration thresholds are model-specific and validation FPR is reported as threshold transfer, not assumed to equal the target.","",f"M2 validation anomaly fraction under the unchanged Round-18 FiLM rule is {np.mean([f(x['anomalous_fraction']) for x in film if x['role']=='validation']):.4f}. Perturbation outputs use the same fine-tuned visual features and original calibration threshold.","",f"Representative V2/M2 raw-episode decode, reference preprocessing, host-to-device, dual-suffix and head first-window latencies are {end_to_end['V2']['cold_first_full_window_with_episode_decode_ms']:.3f}/{end_to_end['M2']['cold_first_full_window_with_episode_decode_ms']:.3f} ms; episode/history-resident streaming medians are {end_to_end['V2']['warm_streaming_new_step_episode_and_history_resident_ms']['median']:.3f}/{end_to_end['M2']['warm_streaming_new_step_episode_and_history_resident_ms']['median']:.3f} ms. Models were resident and the episode file had previously been read, so the first-window number includes decode from a warm OS page cache and is not disk-cold. The locked compute-only benchmark separately reports {cost['V2']['warm_streaming_new_step_ms']['median']:.3f}/{cost['M2']['warm_streaming_new_step_ms']['median']:.3f} ms and excludes decode, preprocessing and host-to-device transfer. No segment medians were summed.","",f"Accepted-attempt training task durations total {task_h:.2f} GPU-task hours; dispatch-to-last-completion elapsed {elapsed_h:.2f} wall hours ({min(s for s,_ in times).isoformat()} to {max(b for _,b in times).isoformat()}), including the hardware interruption. These are different quantities; historical failed-attempt GPU time is not included in accepted-attempt total. Nine runs were preserved from the first wave, and fifteen completed after verified hardware recovery.","","These are overlapping development folds on future-complete Round-17 endpoints with historical upstream validation exposure. Same-image predicted force is not an independent sensor. Results do not establish full-timeline, physical onset, blind-test, causal, or external-domain generalization, and C2 does not exist for a complete factorial claim."]
